---
title: "oauth_code_exchange (stem-system auth/callback/route.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_code: code exists
    [*] --> q_no_code: code is null

    q_check_code --> q_create_client: createServerClient(SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, cookies)
    q_create_client --> q_exchange: supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code)
    q_exchange --> q_check_error: destructure data, error

    q_check_error --> q_success: !error
    q_check_error --> q_error: error

    q_success --> q_build_redirect: response = NextResponse.redirect(redirectUrl, 303)
    q_build_redirect --> q_set_cache: Cache-Control = 'no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0'
    q_set_cache --> q_set_session_cookies: for each pendingCookie set on response
    q_set_session_cookies --> q_clear_oauth_cookies: delete oauth_redirect and oauth_redirect_client cookies
    q_clear_oauth_cookies --> [*]: return redirectResponse

    q_error --> [*]: return redirect to /login?error=error.message

    q_no_code --> [*]: return redirect to /login?error=Could not authenticate user

    note right of q_exchange
        INV-001: exchangeCodeForSession consumes the authorization code exactly once (PKCE flow)
        INV-002: session cookies are set via pendingCookies array collected during exchange
        INV-003: error message from Supabase is URL-encoded but reflected in redirect query string
    end note

    note right of q_set_cache
        INV-004: Cache-Control no-store prevents caching of auth redirect response
        INV-005: HTTP 303 forces GET method on redirect target
    end note
